## Ilford HP5 Plus: HARMAN technology, ILFORD HP5 PLUS technical information (Nov 2018): its raster graphs traced by dev/film/trace_raster_curves.py. Characteristic curve ILFOTEC HC (1+31) 6 1/2 min at 20 C, intermittent agitation, on relative log exposure, placed with density 0.1 over fog at log H -2.70 (ISO 6's speed point for EI 400); wedge spectrogram to tungsten light (2850 K), relative, on the sheet's linear 0-1.0 scale. Ilford publishes no MTF and no rms granularity.. Normal: hc_1_31_6.5; rms granularity 16.0, an estimate (none published); MTF an estimate (2.0 um spread; none published).
